<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>emoekg · {{ meta.title }}</title>

<style>
/* ==========================================================================
   emoekg · Research-Report Aesthetic
   --------------------------------------------------------------------------
   Design direction: Stripe Press × Pentagram × FT Weekend, dark edition.
     · Pure neutrals (near-black → off-white) with one discipline accent.
     · System font stack only — no CDN, no fallbacks to ugly system serifs.
     · Editorial density: big headlines, generous leading, thin dividers.
     · Data, not decoration: zero gratuitous animation.
   ========================================================================== */

:root {
  /* Neutrals — nine-step ramp, no pure black (too harsh) and no pure white
     (strains the eyes). */
  --n-0:  #0b0b0c;   /* page background */
  --n-1:  #111113;   /* surface 1 */
  --n-2:  #17181a;   /* surface 2 (danmaku items / inputs) */
  --n-3:  #1f2023;   /* hover */
  --n-4:  #2a2c30;   /* divider, strong */
  --n-5:  #3a3d43;   /* divider, hairline glow */
  --n-6:  #6b6f77;   /* axis labels, meta */
  --n-7:  #9aa0aa;   /* secondary ink */
  --n-8:  #d4d7dd;   /* primary ink */
  --n-9:  #f5f5f7;   /* titles, pure ink */

  /* Accent — a restrained, editorial orange. Used sparingly: one link
     per zone, one key number per card, one chart line at a time. */
  --acc:       #EB5E28;
  --acc-soft:  #EB5E2833;
  --acc-ghost: #EB5E281A;

  /* Palette for the 8-dim ECG — muted, close in luminance so no one line
     dominates by color alone. Overrides the vivid defaults from plutchik.py
     *only for the chart*; the Plutchik colors are still used for the tiny
     dimension dots in the danmaku list so researchers can cross-reference. */
  --e-joy:         #E6B74F;
  --e-trust:       #84A98C;
  --e-fear:        #6A7FB5;
  --e-surprise:    #C46E7B;
  --e-sadness:     #5B7B9A;
  --e-disgust:     #8B6F9B;
  --e-anger:       #C26E54;
  --e-anticipation:#D08A5C;

  /* Type — 100% system stack. */
  --ff-sans:  -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", "PingFang SC",
              "Hiragino Sans GB", "Microsoft YaHei UI", "HarmonyOS Sans SC",
              "Noto Sans CJK SC", "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
  --ff-serif: ui-serif, Georgia, "Noto Serif CJK SC", "Source Han Serif SC",
              "Songti SC", "SimSun", serif;
  --ff-mono:  ui-monospace, "SF Mono", "Menlo", "Cascadia Mono",
              "Consolas", "Roboto Mono", monospace;

  /* Scale — editorial: big jump between levels. */
  --fs-display: clamp(36px, 4vw, 60px);
  --fs-h1:      clamp(28px, 2.6vw, 36px);
  --fs-h2:      20px;
  --fs-body:    15px;
  --fs-small:   13px;
  --fs-micro:   11px;
}

* { box-sizing: border-box; }
html, body { margin: 0; padding: 0; }
body {
  background-color: #08090b;
  color: var(--n-8);
  font-family: var(--ff-sans);
  font-size: var(--fs-body);
  line-height: 1.55;
  letter-spacing: 0.003em;
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  text-rendering: optimizeLegibility;
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  /* Four-layer atmospheric background so pure-dark never reads as "dead
     pixels". All four are fixed-attached so the lighting stays consistent
     throughout a long scrolled report, instead of repeating per viewport.
       1. Warm amber bleed from top-left    (accent, diffuse)
       2. Cool reflection highlight, top    (screen ambient)
       3. Echo amber bleed from bottom-right (opposite-corner balance)
       4. Fine white dot grain at 3px grid  (film-like texture)
     Peak intensities are all <7% so the overall impression stays
     near-black; the variation is subliminal, not decorative. */
  background-image:
    radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 55% at 3% -8%,
      rgba(235, 94, 40, 0.065) 0%, transparent 52%),
    radial-gradient(ellipse 95% 42% at 50% 0%,
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.028) 0%, transparent 55%),
    radial-gradient(ellipse 45% 35% at 98% 102%,
      rgba(235, 94, 40, 0.035) 0%, transparent 55%),
    radial-gradient(rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.015) 1px, transparent 1px);
  background-size: auto, auto, auto, 3px 3px;
  background-repeat: no-repeat, no-repeat, no-repeat, repeat;
  background-attachment: fixed, fixed, fixed, fixed;
}

a { color: var(--acc); text-decoration: none; }
a:hover { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }

::selection { background: var(--acc-soft); color: var(--n-9); }

/* --- layout scaffold ------------------------------------------------------ */

.shell {
  max-width: 1280px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 40px 56px 96px;
}
@media (max-width: 860px) { .shell { padding: 32px 22px 64px; } }

/* Site header — masthead-esque, single line, low-key. */
.masthead {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  padding-bottom: 14px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--n-4);
  font-family: var(--ff-mono);
  font-size: var(--fs-micro);
  color: var(--n-6);
  letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}
.masthead .brand { color: var(--n-8); font-weight: 600; }
.masthead .brand b { color: var(--acc); }

/* --- HERO ----------------------------------------------------------------- */

.hero {
  padding: 64px 0 48px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--n-4);
}
.hero .eyebrow {
  font-family: var(--ff-mono);
  font-size: var(--fs-micro);
  letter-spacing: 0.22em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--acc);
  margin-bottom: 28px;
}
.hero h1 {
  margin: 0 0 0.2em;
  font-family: var(--ff-serif);
  font-weight: 400;                    /* serif 700 looks bloated; 400 is editorial */
  font-size: var(--fs-display);
  line-height: 1.06;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  color: var(--n-9);
  max-width: 22ch;
}
.hero h1 .sep { color: var(--acc); font-style: normal; }
.hero h1 .brand-ai {
  display: inline-block;
  font-family: var(--ff-mono);
  font-size: 0.34em;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.18em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--acc);
  vertical-align: 0.4em;
  margin-right: 10px;
  padding: 3px 10px;
  border: 1px solid var(--acc);
}
.hero .video-title {
  margin: 28px 0 0;
  font-family: var(--ff-sans);
  font-size: var(--fs-small);
  color: var(--n-6);
  letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  display: flex;
  gap: 10px;
  align-items: baseline;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}
.hero .video-title .l {
  font-family: var(--ff-mono);
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 0.22em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--n-6);
}
.hero .video-title .t {
  color: var(--n-8);
  font-size: 15px;
  font-family: var(--ff-serif);
}
.hero .deck {
  margin: 28px 0 0;
  font-family: var(--ff-serif);
  font-size: 18px;
  line-height: 1.55;
  color: var(--n-7);
  max-width: 62ch;
}

/* Byline strip — "By algorithm, against 221 anonymous voices, over 15:14." */
.byline {
  margin-top: 40px;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
  gap: 0;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--n-4);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--n-4);
}
.byline .cell {
  padding: 18px 0 16px;
  border-right: 1px solid var(--n-4);
}
.byline .cell:last-child { border-right: 0; }
.byline .cell:first-child { padding-left: 0; }
.byline .cell:not(:first-child) { padding-left: 18px; }
.byline .k {
  font-family: var(--ff-mono);
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 0.18em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--n-6);
  margin-bottom: 6px;
}
.byline .v {
  font-family: var(--ff-sans);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 15px;
  color: var(--n-8);
  white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis;
}
.byline .v.mono { font-family: var(--ff-mono); font-weight: 400; color: var(--n-9); }
@media (max-width: 860px) {
  .byline { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  .byline .cell { border-right: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--n-4); padding-left: 0 !important; }
  .byline .cell:nth-child(odd) { border-right: 1px solid var(--n-4); padding-right: 14px; }
}

/* --- SECTION SCAFFOLD ----------------------------------------------------- */
/* Each section is an "instrument panel" — a named design language for the
   report: framed channel with an orange rail on the left, a top bezel
   light hairline, subtle dot grain on the surface, and a single pulsing
   live indicator on the right of the header. The ECG metaphor from the
   core chart extends all the way down into the report's section grammar. */

:root {
  --zone-bg:        #0d0d10;
  --zone-bg-hi:     #111116;
  --zone-border:    #25262b;
  --zone-border-hi: #2d2e34;
  --zone-glow:      rgba(235, 94, 40, 0.55);
}

section.zone {
  position: relative;
  background-color: var(--zone-bg);
  /* Two-layer surface texture: faint top reflection + fine dot grain.
     Denser than the body grain so the panel reads as distinctly "framed". */
  background-image:
    linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.032) 0%, transparent 14%),
    radial-gradient(rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.022) 1px, transparent 1px);
  background-size: 100% 100%, 3px 3px;
  background-position: 0 0, 0 0;
  /* Triple shadow: outer border + inner hairline highlight + drop shadow.
     The dual border creates a subtle frame-in-frame depth that a single
     1px border can't — the panel feels like a metal plate, not a div. */
  box-shadow:
    0 0 0 1px var(--zone-border),
    inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.018),
    0 28px 56px -32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.92);
  padding: 38px 48px 56px 48px;
  margin-top: 40px;
  transition: background-color 260ms ease, box-shadow 260ms ease;
}
section.zone + section.zone { margin-top: 28px; }
section.zone:first-of-type { margin-top: 64px; }

section.zone:hover {
  background-color: var(--zone-bg-hi);
  box-shadow:
    0 0 0 1px var(--zone-border-hi),
    inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.028),
    0 34px 62px -30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.96);
}

/* Left channel rail — 4px gradient strip with strong halo glow */
section.zone::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  left: -1px; top: -1px; bottom: -1px;
  width: 4px;
  background: linear-gradient(to bottom,
    var(--acc) 0%,
    var(--acc) 34%,
    rgba(235, 94, 40, 0.30) 85%,
    rgba(235, 94, 40, 0) 100%);
  box-shadow:
    0 0 24px 0 var(--zone-glow),
    0 0 4px 0 rgba(235, 94, 40, 0.55);
  transition: box-shadow 260ms ease;
  z-index: 2;
}
section.zone:hover::before {
  box-shadow:
    0 0 36px 2px var(--zone-glow),
    0 0 4px 0 rgba(235, 94, 40, 0.6);
}

/* Top bezel-light hairline — 1px orange, fades toward the right */
section.zone::after {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  top: -1px;
  left: 4px;
  right: 0;
  height: 1px;
  background: linear-gradient(to right,
    var(--acc) 0%,
    rgba(235, 94, 40, 0.55) 8%,
    rgba(235, 94, 40, 0.12) 32%,
    rgba(235, 94, 40, 0) 55%);
  pointer-events: none;
  z-index: 2;
}

/* --- SECTION HEADER ------------------------------------------------------- */

.zone-head {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 18px;
  padding: 2px 0 22px 0;
  margin-bottom: 30px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--n-4);
  position: relative;
}

/* Channel chip — the "01" token, editorial-mono inside an accent-lit pill */
.zone-head .no {
  font-family: var(--ff-mono);
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.22em;
  color: var(--acc);
  padding: 7px 14px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(235, 94, 40, 0.55);
  background: rgba(235, 94, 40, 0.08);
  box-shadow:
    0 0 18px -4px rgba(235, 94, 40, 0.5),
    inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(235, 94, 40, 0.08);
  line-height: 1;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

.zone-head h2 {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: var(--ff-serif);
  font-weight: 400;
  font-size: 32px;
  line-height: 1.15;
  letter-spacing: -0.012em;
  color: var(--n-9);
  flex: 1;
}

/* Aside hidden — the pulsing live dot below absorbs its "status" role */
.zone-head .aside { display: none; }

/* Live indicator — one 7px pulsing dot, pinned to the top-right, aligned
   vertically with the chip/title row (not the header midpoint). The magic
   number in translateY is: -(h2_center) = -(22px_bottom_pad / 2) = -11px */
.zone-head::after {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  top: 50%; right: 0;
  transform: translate(0, calc(-50% - 11px));
  width: 7px; height: 7px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--acc);
  box-shadow:
    0 0 0 3px rgba(235, 94, 40, 0.18),
    0 0 14px 0 var(--acc);
  animation: zoneHeartbeat 2.4s ease-in-out infinite;
}
@keyframes zoneHeartbeat {
  0%, 100% { opacity: 1; transform: translate(0, calc(-50% - 11px)) scale(1); }
  50%      { opacity: 0.45; transform: translate(0, calc(-50% - 11px)) scale(0.82); }
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  .zone-head::after { animation: none; }
}

/* --- EXECUTIVE SUMMARY ---------------------------------------------------- */

.tldr {
  margin-top: 48px;
  padding: 40px 0 0;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--n-4);
}
.tldr .lede {
  font-family: var(--ff-serif);
  font-size: clamp(20px, 2.2vw, 28px);
  line-height: 1.42;
  letter-spacing: -0.005em;
  color: var(--n-9);
  max-width: 40ch;
  font-weight: 400;
}
.tldr .lede::before {
  content: '';
  display: inline-block;
  width: 4px;
  height: 0.78em;
  background: var(--acc);
  margin-right: 16px;
  vertical-align: baseline;
  transform: translateY(-0.02em);
  box-shadow: 0 0 10px -2px var(--acc);
}
.tldr .insights {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 0;
  margin-top: 40px;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--n-4);
}
.tldr .insight {
  padding: 24px 28px 24px 0;
  border-right: 1px solid var(--n-4);
}
.tldr .insight:last-child { border-right: 0; }
.tldr .insight:not(:first-child) { padding-left: 28px; }
.tldr .insight .num {
  font-family: var(--ff-mono);
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 0.22em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--acc);
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}
.tldr .insight .title {
  font-family: var(--ff-serif);
  font-size: 18px;
  line-height: 1.3;
  color: var(--n-9);
  margin-bottom: 8px;
  font-weight: 500;
}
.tldr .insight .body {
  font-family: var(--ff-sans);
  font-size: 14px;
  line-height: 1.55;
  color: var(--n-7);
}
@media (max-width: 860px) {
  .tldr .insights { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .tldr .insight { border-right: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--n-4);
                   padding-left: 0 !important; }
  .tldr .insight:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
}

/* --- VITALS (overview strip) ---------------------------------------------- */

.vitals {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 0;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--n-4);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--n-4);
}
.vital {
  padding: 28px 32px 26px 0;
  border-right: 1px solid var(--n-4);
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: background .12s ease;
}
.vital[data-seek]:hover { background: var(--n-1); }
.vital:not(:first-child) { padding-left: 32px; }
.vital:last-child { border-right: 0; padding-right: 0; }
.vital .label {
  font-family: var(--ff-mono);
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 0.22em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--n-6);
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  margin-bottom: 14px;
}
.vital .label .marker {
  font-family: var(--ff-mono);
  font-size: 10px;
  padding: 2px 8px;
  border: 1px solid currentColor;
  letter-spacing: 0.15em;
}
.vital .headline {
  font-family: var(--ff-serif);
  font-weight: 400;
  font-size: clamp(28px, 3vw, 40px);
  line-height: 1.05;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  color: var(--n-9);
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}
.vital .headline .accent { color: var(--acc); }
.vital .detail {
  font-family: var(--ff-sans);
  font-size: 13px;
  color: var(--n-7);
  line-height: 1.5;
}
@media (max-width: 860px) {
  .vitals { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .vital { border-right: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--n-4); padding-left: 0 !important; }
  .vital:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
}

/* --- MONITOR (video + ECG) ------------------------------------------------ */

.monitor-head {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: baseline;
  gap: 16px;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}
.monitor-head .cap {
  font-family: var(--ff-mono);
  font-size: var(--fs-micro);
  letter-spacing: 0.16em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--n-7);
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
}
.monitor-head .hint {
  font-family: var(--ff-sans);
  font-size: 13px;
  color: var(--n-6);
  max-width: 50ch;
  text-align: right;
}

/* --- LIVE TRACE indicator (pulse dot + label) ----------------------------- */
.live-trace {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  font-family: var(--ff-mono);
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 0.22em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--acc);
}
.live-trace .dot {
  width: 8px; height: 8px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--acc);
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 var(--acc);
  animation: pulse 1.6s ease-out infinite;
}
@keyframes pulse {
  0%   { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(235, 94, 40, 0.55); transform: scale(1); }
  70%  { box-shadow: 0 0 0 10px rgba(235, 94, 40, 0); transform: scale(1.08); }
  100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(235, 94, 40, 0); transform: scale(1); }
}
.live-trace .sep { color: var(--n-5); margin: 0 2px; }
.live-trace .freq { color: var(--n-7); }

#video-wrapper {
  width: 100%;
  aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
  background: #000;
  border: 1px solid var(--n-4);
  overflow: hidden;
}
#video-wrapper iframe, #video-wrapper video {
  width: 100%; height: 100%; border: 0; display: block;
}

.ecg-wrap {
  margin-top: 28px;
  padding: 20px 4px 4px;
  border: 1px solid var(--n-4);
  background: var(--n-1);
}
/* Relative box wrapping only the canvas + the decorative overlays.
   We anchor the ECG grid / sweep to the canvas so their insets match
   ECharts' grid offsets (top:44 right:24 bottom:58 left:48) exactly. */
.ecg-canvas-box {
  position: relative;
  width: 100%;
  overflow: hidden;
}
#ecg-chart { width: 100%; height: 460px; position: relative; z-index: 1; }

/* --- ECG "paper" grid (behind the chart, very subtle) ---
   Two layers: a minor 12px grid + a major 60px grid. Only ~5% / 11%
   opacity so the editorial palette is preserved, but the viewer
   instinctively reads the panel as clinical-monitor paper, not a flat
   dark slab. Masked on the edges so it fades into the frame. */
.ecg-canvas-box::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  inset: 44px 24px 58px 48px;   /* matches ECharts grid */
  pointer-events: none;
  z-index: 2;
  background-image:
    linear-gradient(to right,  rgba(235,94,40,0.05) 1px, transparent 1px),
    linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(235,94,40,0.05) 1px, transparent 1px),
    linear-gradient(to right,  rgba(235,94,40,0.11) 1px, transparent 1px),
    linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(235,94,40,0.11) 1px, transparent 1px);
  background-size: 12px 12px, 12px 12px, 60px 60px, 60px 60px;
  mix-blend-mode: screen;
  mask-image: linear-gradient(to right,
    transparent 0%, #000 6%, #000 94%, transparent 100%);
  -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to right,
    transparent 0%, #000 6%, #000 94%, transparent 100%);
}

/* --- ECG sweep (clinical monitor cursor) ---
   One wafer-thin traveling line + a soft trailing afterglow. Period 9s —
   slow enough to feel like instrumentation, fast enough to feel alive.
   The gradient's right edge is the cursor head; everything left is
   phosphor trail. Uses `mix-blend-mode: screen` so it adds light over
   the existing chart traces instead of covering them. */
.ecg-sweep {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 44px 24px 58px 48px;   /* matches ECharts grid */
  pointer-events: none;
  z-index: 3;
  overflow: hidden;
  mask-image: linear-gradient(to right,
    transparent 0%, #000 3%, #000 97%, transparent 100%);
  -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to right,
    transparent 0%, #000 3%, #000 97%, transparent 100%);
}
.ecg-sweep::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  top: 0; bottom: 0;
  left: 0;
  width: 22%;
  background:
    linear-gradient(90deg,
      transparent 0%,
      rgba(235,94,40,0.02) 45%,
      rgba(235,94,40,0.08) 75%,
      rgba(235,94,40,0.22) 93%,
      rgba(235,94,40,0.62) 99%,
      rgba(235,94,40,0.98) 100%);
  box-shadow: inset -1px 0 0 0 rgba(235,94,40,0.9);
  filter: drop-shadow(0 0 6px rgba(235,94,40,0.35));
  mix-blend-mode: screen;
  animation: ecg-sweep 9s linear infinite;
  will-change: transform;
}
@keyframes ecg-sweep {
  0%   { transform: translateX(-22%); }
  100% { transform: translateX(455%); }   /* 100/22 ≈ 4.55 → exits right edge */
}
/* Freeze the sweep for reduced-motion preference. The static grid still
   reads as "monitor"; the sweep is decorative only. */
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  .ecg-sweep::before { animation: none; opacity: 0; }
}

/* --- ANALYSIS SPLIT ------------------------------------------------------- */

.split {
  display: grid;
  /* minmax(0, 1fr) — not `1fr` — is the standard fix for "grid track
     blowout": without it, a single unbreakable danmaku like 「9999...9」
     (90 chars, no spaces) forces its column wider, which steals width
     from the other column. Every filter change re-picks different
     danmakus → column widths would drift. This locks both at 50/50. */
  grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
  gap: 48px;
}
.split > * { min-width: 0; }     /* children can shrink below intrinsic size */
@media (max-width: 1040px) { .split { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 56px; } }

.column-head {
  font-family: var(--ff-mono);
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 0.22em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--n-6);
  padding-bottom: 14px;
  margin-bottom: 18px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--n-4);
  display: flex; justify-content: space-between;
}
.column-head b { color: var(--n-8); font-weight: 600; }

/* Tiny inline legend that sits under a column-head, explaining notation
   used inside the list below (e.g. "6/10" in turnpoint cards). Kept
   deliberately understated — it's a definition, not a headline. */
.column-note {
  font-family: var(--ff-sans);
  font-size: 12px;
  line-height: 1.55;
  color: var(--n-6);
  margin: -10px 0 18px;
}
.column-note b {
  font-family: var(--ff-mono);
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--n-8);
  padding: 1px 4px;
  background: var(--n-2);
  border: 1px solid var(--n-4);
  font-size: 11px;
}

/* ---- turnpoints ---- */

#turnpoints { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
.tp {
  padding: 22px 0;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--n-4);
  cursor: pointer;                         /* toggles collapse */
}
.tp:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
.tp-meta {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px;
  font-family: var(--ff-mono);
  font-size: var(--fs-micro);
  letter-spacing: 0.16em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--n-6);
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}
.tp-meta .id { color: var(--n-8); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.2em; }
/* The time is a real <button> so it reads as interactive; hover underlines
   + accent color make the seek affordance unambiguous. */
.tp-meta button.time {
  all: unset;
  color: var(--n-9);
  font-family: var(--ff-mono);
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  font-size: var(--fs-micro);
  padding: 2px 4px;
  cursor: pointer;
  border-bottom: 1px dashed transparent;
  transition: color .12s, border-color .12s;
}
.tp-meta button.time:hover,
.tp-meta button.time:focus-visible {
  color: var(--acc);
  border-bottom-color: var(--acc);
}
.tp-meta .type {
  padding: 2px 9px;
  border: 1px solid currentColor;
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 0.15em;
}
.tp .head {
  font-family: var(--ff-serif);
  font-size: 18px;
  line-height: 1.4;
  color: var(--n-9);
  margin-bottom: 4px;
  font-weight: 400;
}
/* Supporting technical readout — reads as annotation, not as a second
   headline. Rules of thumb:
   · ~72% the size of .head (visual hierarchy rule).
   · Mono font for the numbers so they align tabularly if stacked.
   · Lower-contrast color (n-6, "meta" grey).
   · Never bold. If any single token needs emphasis it should be done
     with color, not weight. */
.tp .tp-detail {
  font-family: var(--ff-mono);
  font-size: 12px;
  line-height: 1.5;
  color: var(--n-6);
  letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  font-weight: 400;
  margin-top: 2px;
  margin-bottom: 2px;
}
.tp .evidence {
  list-style: none;
  margin: 14px 0 0;
  padding: 14px 0 2px 0;
  border-top: 1px dashed var(--n-4);
}
.tp .evidence li {
  font-family: var(--ff-serif);
  font-size: 15px;
  line-height: 1.55;
  color: var(--n-7);
  padding: 8px 0 8px 22px;
  position: relative;
  font-style: italic;
  /* Force unbreakable strings (e.g. "9999...9" copypasta) to wrap, so the
     evidence list never pushes its parent column wider than 1fr. */
  overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  word-break: break-word;
}
.tp .evidence li::before {
  content: '“';
  position: absolute;
  left: 0; top: -2px;
  font-size: 26px;
  color: var(--acc);
  font-family: var(--ff-serif);
  line-height: 1;
}
.tp .evidence li .t {
  display: inline-block;
  font-family: var(--ff-mono);
  font-style: normal;
  font-size: 11px;
  color: var(--n-6);
  margin-right: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
}
.tp .evidence li button.t {
  all: unset;
  display: inline-block;
  font-family: var(--ff-mono);
  font-size: 11px;
  color: var(--n-6);
  margin-right: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  cursor: pointer;
  padding: 0 3px;
  border-bottom: 1px dashed transparent;
  transition: color .12s, border-color .12s;
}
.tp .evidence li button.t:hover,
.tp .evidence li button.t:focus-visible {
  color: var(--acc);
  border-bottom-color: var(--acc);
}
.tp.collapsed .evidence { display: none; }

/* ---- danmaku list ---- */

#dm-search {
  width: 100%;
  padding: 10px 0;
  background: transparent;
  border: 0;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--n-4);
  color: var(--n-9);
  font-family: var(--ff-sans);
  font-size: 15px;
  outline: none;
  transition: border-color .15s;
}
#dm-search:focus { border-bottom-color: var(--acc); }
#dm-search::placeholder { color: var(--n-6); }

.filter-bar {
  display: flex; gap: 4px; flex-wrap: wrap;
  margin: 18px 0 18px;
}
.filter-bar button {
  background: transparent;
  color: var(--n-7);
  border: 1px solid var(--n-4);
  padding: 5px 12px;
  cursor: pointer;
  font-family: var(--ff-mono);
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 0.18em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  transition: all .12s ease;
}
.filter-bar button:hover { color: var(--n-9); border-color: var(--n-6); }
.filter-bar button.active {
  background: var(--n-9);
  color: var(--n-0);
  border-color: var(--n-9);
}

#danmaku-list {
  max-height: 640px;
  overflow-y: auto;
  scrollbar-width: thin;
  scrollbar-color: var(--n-4) transparent;
}
#danmaku-list::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 6px; }
#danmaku-list::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: var(--n-4); }

#danmaku-list .item {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 60px 1fr 10px;
  align-items: baseline;
  gap: 14px;
  padding: 9px 0;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--n-2);
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: background .1s, padding .12s;
  font-size: 14px;
}
#danmaku-list .item:hover { background: var(--n-1); padding-left: 6px; }
#danmaku-list .item.active {
  background: var(--n-1);
  border-left: 2px solid var(--acc);
  padding-left: 10px;
}
#danmaku-list .item .time {
  font-family: var(--ff-mono);
  font-size: 11px;
  color: var(--n-6);
  letter-spacing: 0.05em;
}
#danmaku-list .item .text {
  color: var(--n-8);
  word-break: break-all;
  overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  line-height: 1.5;
  min-width: 0;                /* allow the 1fr track to actually be 1fr */
}
#danmaku-list .item .dot {
  width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%;
  justify-self: end;
}

/* --- PLUTCHIK WHEEL ------------------------------------------------------ */

.wheel-section {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: minmax(360px, 460px) 1fr;
  gap: 56px;
  align-items: center;
}
@media (max-width: 900px) {
  .wheel-section { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 32px; }
}

.wheel-stage {
  position: relative;
  width: 100%;
  aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
  max-width: 460px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}
.wheel-stage svg { width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block; overflow: visible; }

.wheel-stage .wheel-ring {
  fill: none;
  stroke: var(--n-5);
  stroke-width: 0.6;
  stroke-dasharray: 2 3;
  opacity: 0.35;
}

.wheel-emo {
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: opacity .18s ease;
}
.wheel-emo .wheel-petal {
  fill: var(--emo);
  fill-opacity: 0.72;
  stroke: var(--emo);
  stroke-width: 1.2;
  stroke-opacity: 0.95;
  transition: fill-opacity .18s ease, filter .18s ease;
}
.wheel-emo:hover .wheel-petal {
  fill-opacity: 0.9;
  filter: drop-shadow(0 0 6px var(--emo));
}
.wheel-emo.active .wheel-petal {
  fill-opacity: 1;
  stroke: var(--n-9);
  stroke-width: 1.4;
  filter: drop-shadow(0 0 10px var(--emo));
}
.wheel-emo.dimmed { opacity: 0.32; }
.wheel-emo.dimmed:hover { opacity: 0.7; }

.wheel-score {
  font-family: var(--ff-mono);
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 700;
  fill: #fff;
  paint-order: stroke;
  stroke: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55);
  stroke-width: 2.2;
  stroke-linejoin: round;
  letter-spacing: 0.02em;
}
.wheel-label-cn {
  font-family: var(--ff-serif);
  font-size: 15px;
  font-weight: 500;
  fill: var(--n-9);
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
}
.wheel-label-en {
  font-family: var(--ff-mono);
  font-size: 9px;
  letter-spacing: 0.22em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  fill: var(--n-6);
}

.wheel-hub {
  position: absolute;
  top: 50%; left: 50%;
  transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
  text-align: center;
  pointer-events: none;
  width: 92px;
}
.wheel-hub .hub-k {
  display: block;
  font-family: var(--ff-mono);
  font-size: 9px;
  letter-spacing: 0.22em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--n-6);
  margin-bottom: 6px;
}
.wheel-hub .hub-v {
  display: block;
  font-family: var(--ff-serif);
  font-size: 19px;
  font-weight: 400;
  color: var(--n-9);
  line-height: 1;
}

.wheel-info {
  min-height: 320px;
  padding: 28px 32px;
  background: var(--n-1);
  border: 1px solid var(--n-4);
}
.wheel-info .title {
  display: flex;
  align-items: baseline;
  gap: 14px;
  margin-bottom: 4px;
}
.wheel-info .title .cn {
  font-family: var(--ff-serif);
  font-size: 32px;
  font-weight: 400;
  color: var(--n-9);
  letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  line-height: 1.1;
}
.wheel-info .title .en {
  font-family: var(--ff-mono);
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 0.22em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--n-6);
}
.wheel-info .title .badge {
  margin-left: auto;
  font-family: var(--ff-mono);
  font-size: 9px;
  letter-spacing: 0.22em;
  padding: 4px 10px;
  color: var(--n-0);
  font-weight: 700;
}
.wheel-info .opposite {
  font-family: var(--ff-mono);
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 0.18em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--n-6);
  margin: 0 0 22px;
  padding-bottom: 16px;
  border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--n-4);
}
.wheel-info dl {
  margin: 0;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: minmax(120px, max-content) 1fr;
  gap: 16px 24px;
}
/* Bilingual labels — Chinese primary (sans, semibold), English secondary
   (mono uppercase, muted). Stack on two lines inside the same <dt>. */
.wheel-info dt {
  padding-top: 5px;
  line-height: 1.3;
}
.wheel-info dt .zh {
  display: block;
  font-family: var(--ff-sans);
  font-weight: 600;
  font-size: 12px;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  color: var(--n-8);
}
.wheel-info dt .la {
  display: block;
  font-family: var(--ff-mono);
  font-size: 9px;
  letter-spacing: 0.2em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--n-6);
  margin-top: 3px;
}
/* Bilingual values — Chinese serif on top (primary reading line), English
   italic serif underneath (secondary, editorial-register). Both inherit
   the info panel's serif voice so they feel like one idea in two tongues. */
.wheel-info dd {
  margin: 0;
  line-height: 1.3;
}
.wheel-info dd .zh {
  display: block;
  font-family: var(--ff-serif);
  font-size: 15px;
  line-height: 1.5;
  color: var(--n-9);
  letter-spacing: 0.005em;
}
.wheel-info dd .la {
  display: block;
  font-family: var(--ff-serif);
  font-style: italic;
  font-size: 13px;
  line-height: 1.5;
  color: var(--n-6);
  margin-top: 3px;
  letter-spacing: 0.005em;
}
.wheel-info .stats {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 0;
  margin-top: 26px;
  padding-top: 20px;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--n-4);
}
.wheel-info .stats .cell {
  padding-right: 16px;
  border-right: 1px solid var(--n-4);
}
.wheel-info .stats .cell:last-child { border-right: 0; }
.wheel-info .stats .cell:not(:first-child) { padding-left: 16px; }
.wheel-info .stats .cell.seekable {
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: background .12s ease;
}
.wheel-info .stats .cell.seekable:hover { background: var(--n-2); }
.wheel-info .stats .k {
  display: block;
  font-family: var(--ff-mono);
  font-size: 9px;
  letter-spacing: 0.18em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--n-6);
  margin-bottom: 6px;
}
.wheel-info .stats .v {
  font-family: var(--ff-serif);
  font-size: 22px;
  color: var(--n-9);
  line-height: 1.1;
}
.wheel-info .stats .v b {
  font-family: var(--ff-mono);
  font-size: 11px;
  color: var(--n-6);
  font-weight: 400;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  margin-left: 2px;
}

.wheel-pairs {
  margin-top: 32px;
  padding-top: 18px;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--n-4);
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 10px 14px;
  font-family: var(--ff-mono);
  font-size: var(--fs-micro);
  letter-spacing: 0.16em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--n-7);
  align-items: center;
}
.wheel-pairs .k { color: var(--n-6); margin-right: 4px; }
.wheel-pairs .p {
  cursor: pointer;
  padding: 5px 12px;
  border: 1px solid var(--n-4);
  transition: border-color .15s ease, color .15s ease, background .12s ease;
}
.wheel-pairs .p:hover {
  border-color: var(--acc);
  color: var(--n-9);
  background: var(--acc-ghost);
}

/* --- LEGEND + COLOPHON ---------------------------------------------------- */

.legend {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
  gap: 0;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--n-4);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--n-4);
}
.legend .chip {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
  padding: 14px 0;
  border-right: 1px solid var(--n-4);
  padding-left: 14px;
  font-family: var(--ff-mono);
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--n-7);
}
.legend .chip:nth-child(4n) { border-right: 0; }
.legend .chip:nth-child(-n+4) { /* first row */ }
.legend .chip:first-child { padding-left: 0; }
.legend .chip .sw {
  width: 14px; height: 14px; flex-shrink: 0;
}
.legend .chip b { color: var(--n-9); font-weight: 500; margin-right: 2px; }
@media (max-width: 860px) {
  .legend { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  .legend .chip { border-right: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--n-4); padding-left: 0 !important; }
  .legend .chip:nth-child(odd) { border-right: 1px solid var(--n-4); padding-right: 14px; }
}

.colophon {
  margin-top: 56px;
  padding: 20px 0 0;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--n-4);
  font-family: var(--ff-mono);
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 0.18em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--n-6);
  display: flex; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px;
}
.colophon b { color: var(--n-8); font-weight: 500; }

/* --- Methodology note (under §03) ----------------------------------------- */
.methodology-note {
  margin-top: 36px;
  padding-top: 16px;
  border-top: 1px dashed var(--n-4);
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 120px 1fr;
  gap: 24px;
  font-size: 12px;
  line-height: 1.7;
  color: var(--n-6);
}
.methodology-note .k {
  font-family: var(--ff-mono);
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 0.2em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--n-7);
}
.methodology-note b {
  color: var(--n-8);
  font-weight: 600;
  font-family: var(--ff-mono);
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  padding: 0 2px;
}
@media (max-width: 860px) {
  .methodology-note { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 10px; }
}

/* Print — strip chrome, force light. */
@media print {
  body { background: #fff; color: #111; }
  .masthead, .filter-bar, #dm-search { display: none; }
  .hero h1, .zone-head h2 { color: #000; }
  .vital, .tp, .legend .chip, .byline .cell { border-color: #ccc !important; }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main class="shell">

<!-- =========================== MASTHEAD =========================== -->
<div class="masthead">
  <span class="brand">emoekg <b>·</b> emotional electrocardiogram</span>
  <span>vol. 001 / {{ meta.bvid }} / {{ meta.fetched_at[:10] if meta.fetched_at else '' }}</span>
</div>

<!-- =========================== HERO =========================== -->
<header class="hero">
  <div class="eyebrow">report no. 001 · bilibili danmaku analysis</div>

  <h1><span class="brand-ai">AI</span>情绪心电图<span class="sep">.</span></h1>

  <p class="deck">
    对一段 {{ duration_hms }} 的视频、{{ total_danmaku }} 条观众弹幕进行八维度情绪切片，
    算法识别出 {{ turnpoints_count }} 个关键转折。以下为完整研究档案。
  </p>

  <div class="video-title">
    <span class="l">Subject</span>
    <span class="t">《{{ meta.title }}》</span>
  </div>

  <div class="byline">
    <div class="cell">
      <div class="k">Source</div>
      <div class="v mono">{{ meta.bvid }}</div>
    </div>
    <div class="cell">
      <div class="k">Author</div>
      <div class="v">{{ meta.up }}</div>
    </div>
    <div class="cell">
      <div class="k">Duration</div>
      <div class="v mono">{{ duration_hms }}</div>
    </div>
    <div class="cell">
      <div class="k">Samples</div>
      <div class="v mono">{{ '{:,}'.format(total_danmaku) }}</div>
    </div>
    <div class="cell">
      <div class="k">Turnpoints</div>
      <div class="v mono">{{ turnpoints_count }}</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  {% if insights.summary %}
  <div class="tldr">
    <div class="lede">{{ insights.summary }}</div>
    {% if insights.insights %}
    <div class="insights">
      {% for ins in insights.insights %}
      <div class="insight">
        <div class="num">Insight / {{ '%02d'|format(loop.index) }}</div>
        <div class="title">{{ ins.title }}</div>
        <div class="body">{{ ins.body }}</div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
  {% endif %}
</header>

<!-- =========================== §01 VITALS =========================== -->
<section class="zone">
  <div class="zone-head">
    <span class="no">01</span>
    <h2>全局速览 / Vitals</h2>
    <span class="aside">
      <a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/{{ meta.bvid }}" target="_blank">
        ↗ bilibili source
      </a>
    </span>
  </div>
  <div id="overview"></div>
</section>

<!-- =========================== §02 MONITOR =========================== -->
<section class="zone">
  <div class="zone-head">
    <span class="no">02</span>
    <h2>影像与心电 / Monitor</h2>
    <span class="aside">Lead I + Lead II</span>
  </div>

  <div class="monitor-head">
    <span class="cap">
      <span class="live-trace">
        <span class="dot"></span>LIVE TRACE
        <span class="sep">/</span>
        <span class="freq">Lead I · Source Video</span>
      </span>
    </span>
    <span class="hint">点击下方心电图任意位置可同步跳转视频时刻</span>
  </div>
  <div class="ecg-row">
    <div class="ecg-main">
      <div id="video-wrapper"></div>

      <div class="ecg-wrap">
        <div class="monitor-head" style="padding:0 16px 18px 16px;margin-bottom:0">
          <span class="cap">
            <span class="live-trace">
              <span class="dot"></span>8-DIM PLUTCHIK ECG
              <span class="sep">/</span>
              <span class="freq">Lead II · n={{ total_danmaku }}</span>
            </span>
          </span>
          <span class="hint">悬停查看每 {{ window_size }}s 窗口的完整情绪读数 · 橙色 ▲ 为情绪转折点，悬停看详情、点击同步视频 · 拖动下方滑块缩放时间范围</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ecg-canvas-box">
          <div id="ecg-chart"></div>
          <div class="ecg-sweep" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div id="panel-root" class="danmaku-panel">
      <div class="panel-empty">Panel mounting...</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- =========================== §03 PLUTCHIK WHEEL =========================== -->
<section class="zone">
  <div class="zone-head">
    <span class="no">03</span>
    <h2>情绪盘 / Plutchik Wheel</h2>
    <span class="aside">8 dimensions · click to inspect</span>
  </div>

  <div class="wheel-section">
    <div class="wheel-stage">
      <svg id="plutchik-wheel" viewBox="-200 -200 400 400"
           aria-label="Plutchik emotion wheel" role="img"></svg>
      <div class="wheel-hub">
        <span class="hub-k">Dominant</span>
        <span class="hub-v" id="wheel-hub-value">—</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <aside class="wheel-info" id="wheel-info">
      <div class="title">
        <span class="cn">情绪盘</span>
        <span class="en">Plutchik Wheel</span>
      </div>
      <div class="opposite">点击任一花瓣 · Click any petal</div>
    </aside>
  </div>

  <div class="wheel-pairs">
    <span class="k">对立对 · Opposite pairs</span>
    <span class="p" data-pair="joy,sadness">喜悦 ↔ 悲伤</span>
    <span class="p" data-pair="trust,disgust">信任 ↔ 厌恶</span>
    <span class="p" data-pair="fear,anger">恐惧 ↔ 愤怒</span>
    <span class="p" data-pair="surprise,anticipation">惊奇 ↔ 期待</span>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- =========================== §04 ANALYSIS =========================== -->
<section class="zone">
  <div class="zone-head">
    <span class="no">04</span>
    <h2>转折与原声 / Analysis</h2>
    <span class="aside">{{ turnpoints_count }} turnpoints · {{ total_danmaku }} danmakus</span>
  </div>

  <div class="split">
    <div>
      <div class="column-head">
        <span>Turnpoints</span>
        <b>{{ turnpoints_count }} detected</b>
      </div>
      <div class="column-note">
        数字如 <b>6/10</b> 表示该情绪在此刻的强度得分（10 分满分，0 = 完全没有，10 = 刷屏级爆发）。
      </div>
      <div id="turnpoints"></div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="column-head">
        <span>Danmaku stream</span>
        <b>{{ '{:,}'.format(total_danmaku) }}</b>
      </div>
      <input id="dm-search" placeholder="🔍  搜索弹幕..." />
      <div class="filter-bar" id="dm-filter"></div>
      <div id="danmaku-list"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="methodology-note">
    <span class="k">How to read</span>
    <span>
      每 {{ window_size }} 秒切一片弹幕，按 Plutchik 八维情绪（喜悦 / 信任 / 恐惧 / 惊奇 / 悲伤 / 厌恶 / 愤怒 / 期待）
      各打 <b>0–10 分</b>——0 是完全没有，10 是刷屏级爆发。<br>
      <b>PEAK</b> = 某一情绪在本段达到局部最高分（前后 30–45s 最大值）；
      <b>VALLEY</b> = 局部最低分；
      <b>SHIFT</b> = 相邻两段弹幕的整体情绪分布发生显著转向。<br>
      括号里的 <b>变化 +2.0 分 / 10</b> 表示该维度比上一段高了 2 分；
      <b>JS</b> 是 Jensen–Shannon 散度（0–1），衡量相邻两段情绪分布的差异——越接近 1，情绪"换频道"越彻底。
    </span>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- =========================== §05 LEGEND =========================== -->
<section class="zone">
  <div class="zone-head">
    <span class="no">05</span>
    <h2>维度图例 / Legend</h2>
    <span class="aside">Plutchik 8-dim</span>
  </div>
  <div class="legend" id="legend"></div>
</section>

<!-- =========================== COLOPHON =========================== -->
<div class="colophon">
  <span><b>emoekg</b> · generated {{ meta.fetched_at }}</span>
  <span>window {{ window_size }}s · scipy find_peaks · js divergence · agent-scored</span>
</div>

</main>

<!-- =========================== DATA EMBEDS =========================== -->
<script type="application/json" id="data-meta">{{ meta_json | safe }}</script>
<script type="application/json" id="data-scores">{{ scores_json | safe }}</script>
<script type="application/json" id="data-turnpoints">{{ turnpoints_json | safe }}</script>
<script type="application/json" id="data-danmakus">{{ danmakus_json | safe }}</script>
<script type="application/json" id="data-config">{{ config_json | safe }}</script>

<script>{{ echarts_js | safe }}</script>
<script>{{ app_js | safe }}</script>
</body>
</html>
